msgstr ""
"hapja e një problemi në [reuse-website](https://github.com/fsfe/reuse-"
"website) për pyetje mbi tutorialin, FAQ ose specifikimet;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: site/content/en/tutorial.md
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"opening an issue on [reuse-tool](https://github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool) for "
